  "description": "<p>You are encased in a sphere of water.</p><p>You are <strong>Restrained.</strong></p><p>While <strong>Restrained</strong>, you begin to suffocate. At the start of your turn, you must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check, or fail to get your head out of the water.</p><p>If you fails a number of times greater than <strong>1</strong> + your <strong>Body</strong>, you die immediately as per the rules for <strong>Suffocation</strong>.</p>",
